+/// The single sequenced allocator for `execution_checkpoint_events` ids
+/// (PRD-087, [`INVARIANT_CHECKPOINT_EVENT_SEQUENCE`]). Every writer of that
+/// table — this repository's own `put`/`transition`, the backlog
